==English==
{{wikipedia}}

===Etymology===
From JakeBrake<sup>TM</sup> brand compression brakes. Though a brand name, this term is often used to refer to the device in general.

===Noun===
{{en-noun|head=jake [[brake]]}}

# {{context|slang|lang=en}} Especially on [[trucks]], an [[engine]] [[compression]] [[brake]] that closes the valves in an engine in order to slow the vehicle; an [[engine]] [[retarder]].

